# This folder holds the whole research project, but the public repository
# publishes only what the hosted recommender needs.  Everything is ignored by
# default; each published file is listed below.  A file the app starts to
# import must be added here, or the hosted app will fail to import it.
#
# Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is ignored, so every
# directory on the way to a published file is re-included and its contents
# ignored again.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt

!/.streamlit/
/.streamlit/*
!/.streamlit/config.toml

!/scripts/
/scripts/*

